pullRequestBody:
Publish experimental {package} {version} from source commit `{source}`.

The generated package passed an anonymous Swift build. Review the complete export and provenance. After merge, press Recover: the central publication workflow verifies the exact merge commit, creates the immutable SwiftPM version tag, and creates the GitHub Release. An open PR does not publish a version.

{removed}{ticket}

bootstrapPullRequestBody:
Bootstrap experimental {package} {version} from source commit `{source}`. This replaces the README-only repository with the generated package.

The generated package passed an anonymous Swift build. After merge, press Recover to create the version tag and the GitHub Release.

